Z||000016||Smoooooth GT||11-29-2001||06:46 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Monkeyman:<BR><B><P>SmooothGT--You're right that BlackStang is out of line, but I think it would have been a little more appropriate to just email Cliff.  Starting a thread is just adding fuel to the fire.<P><BR> Maybe it's time for me to go, too.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Monkeyman,<BR>I was'nt trying to add fuel to the fire, I was trying to get it all to stop!! I asked for other's to post here not to show support for myself, but for Cliff to see IT'S NOT JUST ME!! I was going to e-mail Cliff, but, Posted this here 1st not just for Cliff, but, for Blackstang to see his way's because he think's it's just ME!! <BR>and NO you should'nt leave PFF!! You are one of the FieroGod's in my book anyway's!!<P><BR>Cliff, <BR> Don't ban him... maybe this will work for a while. Thank you.<P>Blackstang,<BR> Let's make a deal...... You don't make any... I mean ANY COMMENT nice or not to me and from now on I WILL NEVER MAKE ANY comment toward or about you after this thread is over!!!!<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smooooothgtsig_9.gif">        <BR>www.thefibersmith.com     Technical Support (903) 825-7744 Steve<BR>Shaved door handles, sidetrim, exhaust outlet's, etc.... smooooth!!!||||reg||1
