Z||000020||CoolBlue87GT||11-29-2001||11:34 AM||||I agree with you, Blackstang95 has been out of line in some post's.<P>When he attacked me / my car, I think he was quite suprized by the response of everyone blasting him back.<P>I was really pissed with him, and thought the best way to combat such foolish comments were to show him, I'm above those petty childish way's, and acted in a adult manner.<P>I did speak with Cliff about him, not to attack him, just to get Cliff's advise.<P>We've been here long enough to know the patterns of some of the attacks that not only Blackstang95 has made, but others.<P>The best way to fight it, is to icnore it, and let them think they have won.<P>-- That's hard, I know. I wanted to blast him & attack him back. But then I'd be guilty of the same 'crap'.<P>- In a funny way, Blackstang95 did me a favor !<P>Made my car more known in the Forum & that's fine with me.<P>It's easy to make this a witch hunt, but Cliff's comments were the best, Just let the posts go unanswered until he get back in line.<P>Maybe I'm being to easy on him in some peoples views, but that's my way.<P>That's my two cents.<P>FIERO'S Rule !!  Be cool<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/CoolBluesig.gif">  <BR><p>[This message has been edited by CoolBlue87GT (edited 11-29-2001).]||||reg||6
