Z||000025||BlackStang95||11-29-2001||01:06 PM||||originally posted by kenpo<BR>"I agree! I am so sick and tired of listening to BlackStang starting sh*t on this forum. He insults members, harasses them, calls us names, and hardly liked at all. He keeps on doing this, and his response in this thread is also a prime example. I vote him OFF the island. Or perhaps we should take a roadtrip to his home and..."<P>Damn, that sounded like a threat son.  Sounds like you should be the one banned.  But what the hell, you don't live far away, you can bring it if you want, and bring as many forum members as you think you need, hell we can have a fiero convention at my house for all I care, I don't fear any of you.<P>Sorry you all had to see that, but look at the  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_bs.gif"> I have to put up with.  I don't have a problem with anyone here, I just wish a lot of people who don't know me would back up off me, quit using what I say out of context, etc.  In my mind there is no fight here, there is no thinking I have won, etc.  Smooth Gt has hated me ever since I came to the forums, for no other reason than I made a joke about Nascar.  Since then he's popped up in every thread im in with some stupid flame crap, usually in all capital letters.  After awhile some people (jeffreysuko, kenpo, fierokyle, lots more) jumped on the bandwagon and joined in.  I think a lot of them think they will increase their popularity here by jumping on the bandwagon.  It's interesting that the people I originally had problems here (minngreengt, cheever) stopped hating me once they got to know me.  I've never started any of the fights here, so its basically smooth starting stuff he can't finish, so he has a thread like this instead of pming me or cliff to get the bandwagon members on his side.  <P>All i want is to be treated like anyone else here and have the idiots who don't like me leave me alone and stop whining to mommy (cliff).  That shouldn't be too much to ask.||||reg||1
