Z||000029||Oreif||11-29-2001||02:43 PM||||First, If you read thru the threads of recent, In my opinion, BS95 does post questionable statements. I don't know if he does this on purpose to get a rise out of folks or not. But he does insult people who disagree with him in a highly disrespectful way. (colorful language) Lately he has been more agressive is his posts. The best example was flaming another member in a thread the member wasn't even posting in. I can see him "defending" himself in one thread but to do the above is immature.<BR>Second, This is a <B>Fiero</B> forum. It is here so that all of us who have Fiero's can share knowledge and parts to take care of our cars. Occasionally we get folks here who are interested in Fiero's but have no clue about them. A good example is Matts300ZX, The size of the forum made him curious and aside from his first post being taken wrong by some, he was generally interested in our opinions, idea's and mod's. Now BS95 has no interest in Fiero's except to post incorrect facts he finds on other websites.  An example of his ignorance can be seen in a thread where someone was interested in buying a Fiero. BS95 started spouting incorrect information and when his information was proven wrong, he attempted to "flame" his way out of it.<P>Finally, As for banning him? that is solely Cliff's choice. I, like Cliff, don't feel BS95 has done anything to be "banned", But I do think he needs to learn to respect of others and take to heart the rules of the forum before he crosses the "ban" line.<p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 11-29-2001).]||||reg||1
