Z||000032||kempo||11-29-2001||03:30 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by BlackStang95:<BR><B>Damn, that sounded like a threat son.  Sounds like you should be the one banned.  </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>BlackStang- You just don't learn anything do you?  &lt;sigh&gt;...  As far as threats go, take it how you want it.  If you want it to be a threat, it's your call.  Did I really threaten the likes of you or anybody else?  No.  <P><B>But what the hell, you don't live far away, you can bring it if you want, and bring as many forum members as you think you need, hell we can have a fiero convention at my house for all I care, I don't fear any of you.</B><P>Who said that you had to fear any of us?  Are you really THAT insecure?  As far as having a Fiero Convention at your house, this state has never had any Fiero gatherings that I am aware of.  If you really were serious about holding one, by all means, lets do it, and at least TRY to make it an enjoyable get-together.  <P>And until you can start spelling peoples names corretly, as you apparently need reading glasses, I will refer to you as "Flat Pain" for being just that, a thorn in everybody's side on this entire forum.||||reg||1
