Z||000034||Voytek||11-29-2001||03:31 PM||||[QUOTE]Damn, that sounded like a threat son. Sounds like you should be the one banned. But what the hell, you don't live far away, you can bring it if you want, and bring as many forum members as you think you need, hell we can have a fiero convention at my house for all I care, I don't fear any of you.[/QUOTE0<P>BlackStang - you sound WAAAAY too cocky.  'SON'??  You can't be over 20 and you are calling Kempo 'SON'??<P>See, this is one of the reasons people are fed up with you.  You insult others left and right.  And to top it off, you're here to promote Mustangs.  Don't give me the 'I'm simply defending them' crap.  The word Mustang came up pretty rarely until you showed up.<P>If you keep this one phrase in mind, you'll get along with people much better: THIS IS A FIERO FORUM.<P>Simple enough, isn't it?  Most people here own a Fiero because they chose it over the Mustang.  You're not going to convert anyone. <P>I don't think Smoooooth GT was out of line here by asking for a ban.  If Cliff thinks a bit more time is needed, here's your chance.  Use it.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||1
